# Build context is services/ (see Dockerfile). Send only what the build reads.
# This replaces the service-local .dockerignore, which Docker no longer reads
# once the context is services/; its exclusions are carried over below.
*
!financial-control-svc
!eventing

# Test artifacts
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/

# Deployment files and docs that are not needed inside the image
financial-control-svc/deployments
financial-control-svc/context.md
financial-control-svc/progress.md

# IDE / OS / git noise
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.git
